data: {"type":"data-vendo-build-failed","data":{"toolCallId":"hcall_4_b78f63b0-f12e-4c78-97e6-f936f5d6d299","reason":"app build failed: This app wasn't created, because it didn't pass the checks that keep an app honest: The binding `count(items.data)` counts ALL items regardless of status, but the label promises only active transactions; filter to items where status === 'active' before counting, or rename the label to 'Total Transactions'. The binding `sum(items.data.amount)` sums raw cents for ALL items (including non-active ones) and does not divide by 100, so the displayed dollar figure will be wrong on both counts; filter to active items only and divide the sum by 100 to get the correct dollar total."}}

data: {"type":"tool-output-error","toolCallId":"hcall_4_b78f63b0-f12e-4c78-97e6-f936f5d6d299","errorText":"app build failed: This app wasn't created, because it didn't pass the checks that keep an app honest: The binding `count(items.data)` counts ALL items regardless of status, but the label promises only active transactions; filter to items where status === 'active' before counting, or rename the label to 'Total Transactions'. The binding `sum(items.data.amount)` sums raw cents for ALL items (including non-active ones) and does not divide by 100, so the displayed dollar figure will be wrong on both counts; filter to active items only and divide the sum by 100 to get the correct dollar total.","dynamic":true}

